Add OpenClaw as a harness for Bot Crossing, scanning 2,680+ sessions
across multiple agent directories with smart project detection,
session classification, and cost tracking.

Harness adapter (server/harnesses/openclaw.mjs):
- Scans ~/.openclaw/agents/*/sessions/*.jsonl for all session data
- Smart project detection: parses file paths and GitHub refs to map
  sessions to actual repos (c2, ads-platform, C2UI, etc.) — 16 zones
- Session classification: webhook, cron, subagent, conversation, heartbeat
- Slack channel tagging from inbound metadata
- Cost/token tracking from usage data in assistant messages
- Git branch detection from worktree cwds and .git/HEAD
- Title cleaning: strips system metadata, webhook envelopes, cron brackets
- Thinking detection: identifies model processing vs tool execution
- Sticky running state: 60s hold prevents stat bar flickering
- PR detection (stored in ref, celebrating status disabled as too noisy)
- Deep linking via OPENCLAW_URL env var (default: localhost:18789)

Thinking status (new colony status):
- Purple trim, blue-violet eyes, Idle_B body animation
- Thinking face loop (think1/2/3 — thought bubble dots)
- Purple thought particles drifting above head
- Dedicated badge, stat bar entry, and help legend

Transcript viewer:
- Read-only chat panel in the thread card sidebar
- User/assistant messages with model, timestamps, tool-use badges
- Live transcript tail: auto-updates every 3s for active sessions
  with pulsing LIVE badge and smart auto-scroll

Open button fix:
- Server returns http/https URLs to client without trying xdg-open
- Client opens URL in new tab (guarded to http/https only)
- Button label: 'Open in OpenClaw' (dynamic per harness)

Session search:
- GET /api/search?q= endpoint with 10s thread cache
- Debounced search panel (F or / to open), fly-to-astronaut on click
- Max 20 results with title, project, model, time ago

Activity timeline:
- GET /api/activity endpoint with hourly buckets
- GitHub-style heatmap (week columns, Mon-Sun rows)
- Date range presets (7d/30d/90d/All) + custom date inputs
- Time machine: filters colony to selected date range
- Click a day cell to filter to that day
- Filter badge with clear button

Model heatmap:
- Zones colored by dominant model (Opus purple, GLM green, etc.)
- Settings toggle, legend in sidebar

Auto-archive:
- Settings toggle with configurable dormancy threshold (7-365 days)
- Max 50 archives per poll, toast notification

Stat bar consistency:
- statusAgents cache ensures click always finds the counted agent
- Active threads sort to front of roster (above maxAgents cap)
- Zero-count stats hidden
